    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Update: Paperback is now Free! Multiplayer server is offline, but you can play online the new sequel, Paperback Vol. 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Word-building meets deck-building in the unique game Paperback. Players start with a deck of letter cards and wild cards. This is like their own bag of \u2018scrabble\u2019 tiles. With each hand of cards you make a word and score it. This score is how much money you have to purchase more cards for your deck. Collect cool letters with abilities, such as drawing more cards or double word score. Buy Novel cards to gain \u2018fame\u2019 points to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Local play with up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 3 levels of AI opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Tons of cool card powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Classic pulp novel artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Win with wordsmithing or power combos - up to you!</p>",
